From 21a6ea58bfe86dd77cf3c6db3bdf37003184e0ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:27:07 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(2d): clear outside containment to stock on clearing ops

Implement #2232 Option 1 so clearing operations (2D Adaptive, 2D Pocket,
2D Offset, 3D Pocket) with Containment::Outside and a closed selection
clear from setup stock (+2r air band) inward to the selected face or
edge while keeping enclosed pockets inside their walls. Filter
sub-tolerance Clipper arc-chord slivers in non_sliver_center and name
Extension (Boundary) and setup stock in narrow-band Outside refusals.

Fixes #2232
